.\" excerpt: util-linux lsblk(8), Debian trixie
.TH LSBLK 8
.SH NAME
lsblk \- list block devices
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
.B -a , --all
.RS 4
List all block devices.
.RE
.PP
.B -o , --output
.I list
.RS 4
Specify which output columns to print.
.PP
.B +list
.RS 4
Extend the default columns, not another option.
.RE
.RE
.PP
\fB--hyperlink\fR[\fB=\fR\fImode\fR]
.RS 4
Print mountpoint paths as terminal hyperlinks.
.RE
.\" numeric syntax from mkswap/setterm OPTIONS
.PP
\fB-v\fR, \fB--swapversion 1\fR
.RS 4
Specify swap-space version 1.
.RE
.PP
\fB--blank\fR[\fB=0\fR-\fB60\fR|\fBforce\fR|\fBpoke\fR]
.RS 4
Set terminal blanking.
.RE
